* Added the composite PQ algorithm MLDSA44-Ed25519-SHA512.
* Required From header fields to be Authentic.
* Outlawed duplicate JSON keys.
* Added "u" steps in Recipes to handle non UTF-8 characters. Also
  added patterns to the JSON schema to aid validity checking.
* Resurrected tag=value definition.
* Substantial rework of verification text to ensure it only
  states how to check for a Validly Signed DKIM2 Message, moving
  consideration of what that means into its own section.
* Rework of several Signer requirements, tying down several loose ends.
* Substantial rework of the description of the relaxed domain match.
* Substantial rework of the description of DKIM Replay.
* Chain of Custody checking now deals with null MAIL FROM and nd=.
* New glossary entries.
* An EAI section has been added.
* A security considerations section has been added.
* Multiple other improvements and corrections.

