{:numbered="false"}

* Corrected mentions of non-existent PERMFAIL.
* Clarified that PASS (etc) does not mean a message is valuable or
  that modifications are benign.
* Added instructions for Verifiers to check for DKIM Replay.
* Tweaks to text and errors relating to too many algorithms
  or selectors; or for when signatures/hashes fail.

