* Added sha512 to allow testing of hash function dexterity.
* Removed SHOULD NOT for speciously added Message-Instance fields,
  we now just point out they are pointless.
* Added text to forbid repetition of the same hash algorithm or
  the same Selector in any given header field. Provided messages
  for reporting infractions.
* Now specifies that header field names in the JSON Recipes
  MUST be lower case; and Verifiers should now report JSON
  issues specifically.
* Made Capitalization Consistent.

